nvoice unless Harbor Outfitters confirms cancellation in writing. Customers should continue to distinguish an unpaid balance from an amount under review. A review may result in a credit, a corrected invoice, or no change, depending on what the records show. A customer should not treat a request for investigation as proof that a refund has been approved.",
